flowchart TB
  subgraph I[Versioned research inputs]
    A[Phishing dataset A: source, label and date]
    B[Dataset B or proxy cohort: terms and limits]
    M[Manifest: URL, hash, version, license, label semantics]
  end
  A --> P[Ingest without visiting live URLs]
  B --> P
  M --> P
  P --> N[Normalize URL and IDNA; preserve original]
  N --> D[Deduplicate and group by registrable domain]
  D --> S[Split generator: random reference / domain-held-out / source-held-out / temporal if valid]
  S --> F[Feature builder: character n-grams / lexical / lookalike rules]
  F --> L[Baseline A: TF-IDF + logistic regression]
  F --> T[Baseline B: lexical features + tree model]
  F --> R[Baseline C: rule-only lookalike generator]
  L --> V[Validation-only calibration and fixed review threshold]
  T --> V
  R --> E[Evaluation and error analysis]
  V --> E
  S --> E
  E --> U[Results UI: metrics, split manifest, per-case evidence]
  E --> X[Export: metrics, confidence intervals, hashes and reproducibility manifest]
  subgraph Q[Test isolation]
    Tst[Test labels isolated until scoring]
  end
  Tst --> E
